                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "02105e1e-a33b-37d1-b0f6-d2ff05b1b8a5",
                        "entry_id": "34897c72-0c37-358b-8eab-b82f4866f00c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sicilian (native or inhabitant of Sicily, Italy) (usually male)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe089801-973e-4e5e-9c8b-8a03beab82eb",
                                "sense_id": "02105e1e-a33b-37d1-b0f6-d2ff05b1b8a5",
                                "text": "К ним приставили самую красивую и умелую горничную, бельгийку, с тонкой и твёрдой от корсета талией и в крахмальном чепчике в виде маленькой зубчатой короны, самого видного из лакеев, угольно-чёрного, огнеглазого сицилийца, и самого расторопного коридорного, маленького и полного Луиджи, много переменившего подобных мест на своём веку.",
                                "translation": "To them was assigned the ablest and handsomest chambermaid, a Belgian, whose waist was slenderly and firmly corseted, and whose tiny starched cap looked like a scalloped crown; also, the best-looking and most dignified of flunkies, a fiery-eyed Sicilian, black as coal; and the nimblest of bell-boys, the short and stout Luigi, a fellow who was very fond of a joke, and who had served many masters in his time.",
                                "english": "To them was assigned the ablest and handsomest chambermaid, a Belgian, whose waist was slenderly and firmly corseted, and whose tiny starched cap looked like a scalloped crown; also, the best-looking and most dignified of flunkies, a fiery-eyed Sicilian, black as coal; and the nimblest of bell-boys, the short and stout Luigi, a fellow who was very fond of a joke, and who had served many masters in his time."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
